{"version":2,"surah":75,"verses":[{"n":1,"key":"75:1","arabic":" لَآ أُقْسِمُ بِيَوْمِ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"I swear by the Day of Resurrection","id":"Aku bersumpah dengan hari Kiamat,","latinEn":"La oqsimu biyawmi alqiyamat","latinId":"Lā uqsimu biyaumil-qiyāmah(ti).","words":[{"a":"لَآ","en":"Nay","id":"Nay","t":"lā"},{"a":"أُقْسِمُ","en":"I swear","id":"I swear","t":"uq'simu"},{"a":"بِيَوْمِ","en":"by (the) Day","id":"by (the) Day","t":"biyawmi"},{"a":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","en":"(of) the Resurrection","id":"(of) the Resurrection","t":"l-qiyāmati"}]},{"n":2,"key":"75:2","arabic":"وَلَآ أُقْسِمُ بِٱلنَّفْسِ ٱللَّوَّامَةِ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"And I swear by the reproaching soul [to the certainty of resurrection].","id":"dan aku bersumpah demi jiwa yang selalu menyesali (dirinya sendiri).","latinEn":"Wala oqsimu binnafsi allawwamat","latinId":"Wa lā uqsimu bin nafsil-lawwāmah(ti).","words":[{"a":"وَلَآ","en":"And nay","id":"And nay","t":"walā"},{"a":"أُقْسِمُ","en":"I swear","id":"I swear","t":"uq'simu"},{"a":"بِٱلنَّفْسِ","en":"by the soul","id":"by the soul","t":"bil-nafsi"},{"a":"ٱللَّوَّامَةِ","en":"self-accusing","id":"self-accusing","t":"l-lawāmati"}]},{"n":3,"key":"75:3","arabic":"أَيَحْسَبُ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ أَلَّن نَّجْمَعَ عِظَامَهُۥ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"Does man think that We will not assemble his bones?","id":"Apakah manusia mengira, bahwa Kami tidak akan mengumpulkan (kembali) tulang belulangnya?","latinEn":"Ayahsabu al-insanu allannajmaAAa AAithamah","latinId":"Ayaḥsabul-insānu allan najma‘a ‘iẓāmah(ū).","words":[{"a":"أَيَحْسَبُ","en":"Does think","id":"Does think","t":"ayaḥsabu"},{"a":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","en":"[the] man","id":"[the] man","t":"l-insānu"},{"a":"أَلَّن","en":"that not","id":"that not","t":"allan"},{"a":"نَّجْمَعَ","en":"We will assemble","id":"We will assemble","t":"najmaʿa"},{"a":"عِظَامَهُۥ","en":"his bones","id":"his bones","t":"ʿiẓāmahu"}]},{"n":4,"key":"75:4","arabic":"بَلَىٰ قَـٰدِرِينَ عَلَىٰٓ أَن نُّسَوِّىَ بَنَانَهُۥ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"Yes. [We are] Able [even] to proportion his fingertips.","id":"(Bahkan) Kami mampu menyusun (kembali) jari jemarinya dengan sempurna.","latinEn":"Bala qadireena AAala annusawwiya bananah","latinId":"Balā qādirīna ‘alā an nusawwiya banānah(ū).","words":[{"a":"بَلَىٰ","en":"Nay","id":"Nay","t":"balā"},{"a":"قَـٰدِرِينَ","en":"(We are) Able","id":"(We are) Able","t":"qādirīna"},{"a":"عَلَىٰٓ","en":"on","id":"on","t":"ʿalā"},{"a":"أَن","en":"that","id":"that","t":"an"},{"a":"نُّسَوِّىَ","en":"We can restore","id":"We can restore","t":"nusawwiya"},{"a":"بَنَانَهُۥ","en":"his fingertips","id":"his fingertips","t":"banānahu"}]},{"n":5,"key":"75:5","arabic":"بَلْ يُرِيدُ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ لِيَفْجُرَ أَمَامَهُۥ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"But man desires to continue in sin.","id":"Tetapi manusia hendak membuat maksiat terus menerus.","latinEn":"Bal yureedu al-insanu liyafjura amamah","latinId":"Bal yurīdul-insānu liyafjura amāmah(ū).","words":[{"a":"بَلْ","en":"Nay","id":"Nay","t":"bal"},{"a":"يُرِيدُ","en":"Desires","id":"Desires","t":"yurīdu"},{"a":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","en":"[the] man","id":"[the] man","t":"l-insānu"},{"a":"لِيَفْجُرَ","en":"to give (the) lie","id":"to give (the) lie","t":"liyafjura"},{"a":"أَمَامَهُۥ","en":"(to) what is before him","id":"(to) what is before him","t":"amāmahu"}]},{"n":6,"key":"75:6","arabic":"يَسْـَٔلُ أَيَّانَ يَوْمُ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"He asks, \"When is the Day of Resurrection?\"","id":"Dia bertanya, \"Kapankah hari Kiamat itu?\"","latinEn":"Yas-alu ayyana yawmu alqiyama","latinId":"Yas'alu ayyāna yaumul-qiyāmah(ti).","words":[{"a":"يَسْـَٔلُ","en":"He asks","id":"He asks","t":"yasalu"},{"a":"أَيَّانَ","en":"When","id":"When","t":"ayyāna"},{"a":"يَوْمُ","en":"(is the) Day","id":"(is the) Day","t":"yawmu"},{"a":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","en":"(of) the Resurrection","id":"(of) the Resurrection","t":"l-qiyāmati"}]},{"n":7,"key":"75:7","arabic":"فَإِذَا بَرِقَ ٱلْبَصَرُ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"So when vision is dazzled.","id":"Maka apabila mata terbelalak (ketakutan),","latinEn":"Fa-itha bariqa albasar","latinId":"Fa iżā bariqal-baṣar(u).","words":[{"a":"فَإِذَا","en":"So when","id":"So when","t":"fa-idhā"},{"a":"بَرِقَ","en":"is dazzled","id":"is dazzled","t":"bariqa"},{"a":"ٱلْبَصَرُ","en":"the vision","id":"the vision","t":"l-baṣaru"}]},{"n":8,"key":"75:8","arabic":"وَخَسَفَ ٱلْقَمَرُ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"And the moon darkens.","id":"dan bulan pun telah hilang cahayanya,","latinEn":"Wakhasafa alqamar","latinId":"Wa khasafal-qamar(u).","words":[{"a":"وَخَسَفَ","en":"And becomes dark","id":"And becomes dark","t":"wakhasafa"},{"a":"ٱلْقَمَرُ","en":"the moon","id":"the moon","t":"l-qamaru"}]},{"n":9,"key":"75:9","arabic":"وَجُمِعَ ٱلشَّمْسُ وَٱلْقَمَرُ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"And the sun and the moon are joined,","id":"lalu matahari dan bulan dikumpulkan,","latinEn":"WajumiAAa ashshamsu walqamar","latinId":"Wa jumi‘asy-syamsu wal-qamar(u).","words":[{"a":"وَجُمِعَ","en":"And are joined","id":"And are joined","t":"wajumiʿa"},{"a":"ٱلشَّمْسُ","en":"the sun","id":"the sun","t":"l-shamsu"},{"a":"وَٱلْقَمَرُ","en":"and the moon","id":"and the moon","t":"wal-qamaru"}]},{"n":10,"key":"75:10","arabic":"يَقُولُ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ يَوْمَئِذٍ أَيْنَ ٱلْمَفَرُّ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"Man will say on that Day, \"Where is the [place of] escape?\"","id":"pada hari itu manusia berkata, \"Ke mana tempat pelarian?\"","latinEn":"Yaqoolu al-insanu yawma-ithinayna almafar","latinId":"Yaqūlul-insānu yauma'iżin ainal-mafarr(u).","words":[{"a":"يَقُولُ","en":"Will say","id":"Will say","t":"yaqūlu"},{"a":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","en":"[the] man","id":"[the] man","t":"l-insānu"},{"a":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","en":"that Day","id":"that Day","t":"yawma-idhin"},{"a":"أَيْنَ","en":"Where","id":"Where","t":"ayna"},{"a":"ٱلْمَفَرُّ","en":"(is) the escape","id":"(is) the escape","t":"l-mafaru"}]},{"n":11,"key":"75:11","arabic":"كَلَّا لَا وَزَرَ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"No! There is no refuge.","id":"Tidak! Tidak ada tempat berlindung!","latinEn":"Kalla la wazar","latinId":"Kallā lā wazar(a).","words":[{"a":"كَلَّا","en":"By no means","id":"By no means","t":"kallā"},{"a":"لَا","en":"(There is) no","id":"(There is) no","t":"lā"},{"a":"وَزَرَ","en":"refuge","id":"refuge","t":"wazara"}]},{"n":12,"key":"75:12","arabic":"إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ يَوْمَئِذٍ ٱلْمُسْتَقَرُّ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"To your Lord, that Day, is the [place of] permanence.","id":"Hanya kepada Tuhanmu tempat kembali pada hari itu.","latinEn":"Ila rabbika yawma-ithinalmustaqar","latinId":"Ilā rabbika yauma'iżinil-mustaqarr(u).","words":[{"a":"إِلَىٰ","en":"To","id":"To","t":"ilā"},{"a":"رَبِّكَ","en":"your Lord","id":"your Lord","t":"rabbika"},{"a":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","en":"that Day","id":"that Day","t":"yawma-idhin"},{"a":"ٱلْمُسْتَقَرُّ","en":"(is) the place of rest","id":"(is) the place of rest","t":"l-mus'taqaru"}]},{"n":13,"key":"75:13","arabic":"يُنَبَّؤُا۟ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ يَوْمَئِذٍۭ بِمَا قَدَّمَ وَأَخَّرَ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"Man will be informed that Day of what he sent ahead and kept back.","id":"Pada hari itu diberitakan kepada manusia apa yang telah dikerjakannya dan apa yang dilalaikannya.","latinEn":"Yunabbao al-insanu yawma-ithinbima qaddama waakhkhar","latinId":"Yunabba'ul-insānu yauma'iżim bimā qaddama wa akhkhar(a).","words":[{"a":"يُنَبَّؤُا۟","en":"Will be informed","id":"Will be informed","t":"yunabba-u"},{"a":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","en":"[the] man","id":"[the] man","t":"l-insānu"},{"a":"يَوْمَئِذٍۭ","en":"that Day","id":"that Day","t":"yawma-idhin"},{"a":"بِمَا","en":"of what","id":"of what","t":"bimā"},{"a":"قَدَّمَ","en":"he sent forth","id":"he sent forth","t":"qaddama"},{"a":"وَأَخَّرَ","en":"and kept back","id":"and kept back","t":"wa-akhara"}]},{"n":14,"key":"75:14","arabic":"بَلِ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ عَلَىٰ نَفْسِهِۦ بَصِيرَةٌ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"Rather, man, against himself, will be a witness,","id":"Bahkan manusia menjadi saksi atas dirinya sendiri,","latinEn":"Bali al-insanu AAala nafsihibaseera","latinId":"Balil-insānu ‘alā nafsihī baṣīrah(tun).","words":[{"a":"بَلِ","en":"Nay","id":"Nay","t":"bali"},{"a":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","en":"[The] man","id":"[The] man","t":"l-insānu"},{"a":"عَلَىٰ","en":"against","id":"against","t":"ʿalā"},{"a":"نَفْسِهِۦ","en":"himself","id":"himself","t":"nafsihi"},{"a":"بَصِيرَةٌۭ","en":"(will be) a witness","id":"(will be) a witness","t":"baṣīratun"}]},{"n":15,"key":"75:15","arabic":"وَلَوْ أَلْقَىٰ مَعَاذِيرَهُۥ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"Even if he presents his excuses.","id":"dan meskipun dia mengemukakan alasan-alasannya.","latinEn":"Walaw alqa maAAatheerah","latinId":"Wa lau alqā ma‘āżīrah(ū).","words":[{"a":"وَلَوْ","en":"Even if","id":"Even if","t":"walaw"},{"a":"أَلْقَىٰ","en":"he presents","id":"he presents","t":"alqā"},{"a":"مَعَاذِيرَهُۥ","en":"his excuses","id":"his excuses","t":"maʿādhīrahu"}]},{"n":16,"key":"75:16","arabic":"لَا تُحَرِّكْ بِهِۦ لِسَانَكَ لِتَعْجَلَ بِهِۦٓ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"Move not your tongue with it, [O Muḥammad], to hasten with it [i.e., recitation of the Qur’ān].","id":"Jangan engkau (Muhammad) gerakkan lidahmu (untuk membaca Alquran) karena hendak cepat-cepat (menguasai)nya.","latinEn":"La tuharrik bihi lisanakalitaAAjala bih","latinId":"Lā tuḥarrik bihī lisānaka lita‘jala bih(ī).","words":[{"a":"لَا","en":"Not","id":"Not","t":"lā"},{"a":"تُحَرِّكْ","en":"move","id":"move","t":"tuḥarrik"},{"a":"بِهِۦ","en":"with it","id":"with it","t":"bihi"},{"a":"لِسَانَكَ","en":"your tongue","id":"your tongue","t":"lisānaka"},{"a":"لِتَعْجَلَ","en":"to hasten","id":"to hasten","t":"litaʿjala"},{"a":"بِهِۦٓ","en":"with it","id":"with it","t":"bihi"}]},{"n":17,"key":"75:17","arabic":"إِنَّ عَلَيْنَا جَمْعَهُۥ وَقُرْءَانَهُۥ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"Indeed, upon Us is its collection [in your heart] and [to make possible] its recitation.","id":"Sesungguhnya Kami yang akan mengumpulkannya (di dadamu) dan membacakannya.","latinEn":"Inna AAalayna jamAAahu waqur-anah","latinId":"Inna ‘alainā jam‘ahū wa qur'ānah(ū).","words":[{"a":"إِنَّ","en":"Indeed","id":"Indeed","t":"inna"},{"a":"عَلَيْنَا","en":"upon Us","id":"upon Us","t":"ʿalaynā"},{"a":"جَمْعَهُۥ","en":"(is) its collection","id":"(is) its collection","t":"jamʿahu"},{"a":"وَقُرْءَانَهُۥ","en":"and its recitation","id":"and its recitation","t":"waqur'ānahu"}]},{"n":18,"key":"75:18","arabic":"فَإِذَا قَرَأْنَـٰهُ فَٱتَّبِعْ قُرْءَانَهُۥ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"So when We have recited it [through Gabriel], then follow its recitation.","id":"Apabila Kami telah selesai membacakannya maka ikutilah bacaannya itu.","latinEn":"Fa-itha qara/nahu fattabiAAqur-anah","latinId":"Fa iżā qara'nāhu fattabi‘ qur'ānah(ū).","words":[{"a":"فَإِذَا","en":"And when","id":"And when","t":"fa-idhā"},{"a":"قَرَأْنَـٰهُ","en":"We have recited it","id":"We have recited it","t":"qaranāhu"},{"a":"فَٱتَّبِعْ","en":"then follow","id":"then follow","t":"fa-ittabiʿ"},{"a":"قُرْءَانَهُۥ","en":"its recitation","id":"its recitation","t":"qur'ānahu"}]},{"n":19,"key":"75:19","arabic":"ثُمَّ إِنَّ عَلَيْنَا بَيَانَهُۥ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"Then upon Us is its clarification [to you].","id":"Kemudian sesungguhnya Kami yang akan menjelaskannya.","latinEn":"Thumma inna AAalayna bayanah","latinId":"Ṡumma inna ‘alainā bayānah(ū).","words":[{"a":"ثُمَّ","en":"Then","id":"Then","t":"thumma"},{"a":"إِنَّ","en":"indeed","id":"indeed","t":"inna"},{"a":"عَلَيْنَا","en":"upon Us","id":"upon Us","t":"ʿalaynā"},{"a":"بَيَانَهُۥ","en":"(is) its explanation","id":"(is) its explanation","t":"bayānahu"}]},{"n":20,"key":"75:20","arabic":"كَلَّا بَلْ تُحِبُّونَ ٱلْعَاجِلَةَ","page":578,"juz":29,"en":"No! But you [i.e., mankind] love the immediate","id":"Tidak! Bahkan Kamu mencintai kehidupan dunia,","latinEn":"Kalla bal tuhibboona alAAajila","latinId":"Kallā bal tuḥibbūnal-‘ājilah(ta).","words":[{"a":"كَلَّا","en":"No","id":"No","t":"kallā"},{"a":"بَلْ","en":"But","id":"But","t":"bal"},{"a":"تُحِبُّونَ","en":"you love","id":"you love","t":"tuḥibbūna"},{"a":"ٱلْعَاجِلَةَ","en":"the immediate","id":"the immediate","t":"l-ʿājilata"}]},{"n":21,"key":"75:21","arabic":"وَتَذَرُونَ ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةَ","page":578,"juz":29,"en":"And leave [i.e., neglect] the Hereafter.","id":"dan mengabaikan (kehidupan) akhirat.","latinEn":"Watatharoona al-akhira","latinId":"Wa tażarūnal-‘ākhirah(ta).","words":[{"a":"وَتَذَرُونَ","en":"And leave","id":"And leave","t":"watadharūna"},{"a":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةَ","en":"the Hereafter","id":"the Hereafter","t":"l-ākhirata"}]},{"n":22,"key":"75:22","arabic":"وُجُوهٌ يَوْمَئِذٍ نَّاضِرَةٌ","page":578,"juz":29,"en":"[Some] faces, that Day, will be radiant,","id":"Wajah-wajah (orang mukmin) pada hari itu berseri-seri.","latinEn":"Wujoohun yawma-ithin nadira","latinId":"Wujūhuy yauma'iżin nāḍirah(tun).","words":[{"a":"وُجُوهٌۭ","en":"Faces","id":"Faces","t":"wujūhun"},{"a":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","en":"that Day","id":"that Day","t":"yawma-idhin"},{"a":"نَّاضِرَةٌ","en":"(will be) radiant","id":"(will be) radiant","t":"nāḍiratun"}]},{"n":23,"key":"75:23","arabic":"إِلَىٰ رَبِّهَا نَاظِرَةٌ","page":578,"juz":29,"en":"Looking at their Lord.","id":"Memandang Tuhannya.","latinEn":"Ila rabbiha nathira","latinId":"Ilā rabbihā nāẓirah(tun).","words":[{"a":"إِلَىٰ","en":"Towards","id":"Towards","t":"ilā"},{"a":"رَبِّهَا","en":"their Lord","id":"their Lord","t":"rabbihā"},{"a":"نَاظِرَةٌۭ","en":"looking","id":"looking","t":"nāẓiratun"}]},{"n":24,"key":"75:24","arabic":"وَوُجُوهٌ يَوْمَئِذٍۭ بَاسِرَةٌ","page":578,"juz":29,"en":"And [some] faces, that Day, will be contorted,","id":"Dan wajah-wajah (orang kafir) pada hari itu muram,","latinEn":"Wawujoohun yawma-ithin basira","latinId":"Wa wujūhuy yauma'iżim bāsirah(tun).","words":[{"a":"وَوُجُوهٌۭ","en":"And faces","id":"And faces","t":"wawujūhun"},{"a":"يَوْمَئِذٍۭ","en":"that Day","id":"that Day","t":"yawma-idhin"},{"a":"بَاسِرَةٌۭ","en":"(will be) distorted","id":"(will be) distorted","t":"bāsiratun"}]},{"n":25,"key":"75:25","arabic":"تَظُنُّ أَن يُفْعَلَ بِهَا فَاقِرَةٌ","page":578,"juz":29,"en":"Expecting that there will be done to them [something] backbreaking.","id":"mereka yakin bahwa akan ditimpakan kepadanya malapetaka yang sangat dahsyat.","latinEn":"Tathunnu an yufAAala bihafaqira","latinId":"Taẓunnu ay yuf‘ala bihā fāqirah(tun).","words":[{"a":"تَظُنُّ","en":"Thinking","id":"Thinking","t":"taẓunnu"},{"a":"أَن","en":"that","id":"that","t":"an"},{"a":"يُفْعَلَ","en":"will be done","id":"will be done","t":"yuf'ʿala"},{"a":"بِهَا","en":"to them","id":"to them","t":"bihā"},{"a":"فَاقِرَةٌۭ","en":"backbreaking","id":"backbreaking","t":"fāqiratun"}]},{"n":26,"key":"75:26","arabic":"كَلَّآ إِذَا بَلَغَتِ ٱلتَّرَاقِىَ","page":578,"juz":29,"en":"No! When it [i.e., the soul] has reached the collar bones","id":"Tidak! Apabila (nyawa) telah sampai ke kerongkongan,","latinEn":"Kalla itha balaghati attaraqiy","latinId":"Kallā iżā balagatit-tarāqiy(a).","words":[{"a":"كَلَّآ","en":"No","id":"No","t":"kallā"},{"a":"إِذَا","en":"When","id":"When","t":"idhā"},{"a":"بَلَغَتِ","en":"it reaches","id":"it reaches","t":"balaghati"},{"a":"ٱلتَّرَاقِىَ","en":"the collar bones","id":"the collar bones","t":"l-tarāqiya"}]},{"n":27,"key":"75:27","arabic":"وَقِيلَ مَنْ ۜ رَاقٍ","page":578,"juz":29,"en":"And it is said, \"Who will cure [him]?\"","id":"dan dikatakan (kepadanya), \"Siapa yang dapat menyembuhkan?\"","latinEn":"Waqeela man raq","latinId":"Wa qīla man…rāq(in).","words":[{"a":"وَقِيلَ","en":"And it is said","id":"And it is said","t":"waqīla"},{"a":"مَنْ ۜ","en":"Who","id":"Who","t":"man"},{"a":"رَاقٍۢ","en":"(will) cure","id":"(will) cure","t":"rāqin"}]},{"n":28,"key":"75:28","arabic":"وَظَنَّ أَنَّهُ ٱلْفِرَاقُ","page":578,"juz":29,"en":"And he [i.e., the dying one] is certain that it is the [time of] separation","id":"dan dia yakin bahwa itulah waktu perpisahan (dengan dunia),","latinEn":"Wathanna annahu alfiraq","latinId":"Wa ẓanna annahul-firāq(u).","words":[{"a":"وَظَنَّ","en":"And he is certain","id":"And he is certain","t":"waẓanna"},{"a":"أَنَّهُ","en":"that it","id":"that it","t":"annahu"},{"a":"ٱلْفِرَاقُ","en":"(is) the parting","id":"(is) the parting","t":"l-firāqu"}]},{"n":29,"key":"75:29","arabic":"وَٱلْتَفَّتِ ٱلسَّاقُ بِٱلسَّاقِ","page":578,"juz":29,"en":"And the leg is wound about the leg,","id":"dan bertaut betis (kiri) dengan betis (kanan),","latinEn":"Waltaffati assaqu bilssaq","latinId":"Waltaffatis-sāqu bis-sāq(i).","words":[{"a":"وَٱلْتَفَّتِ","en":"And is wound","id":"And is wound","t":"wal-tafati"},{"a":"ٱلسَّاقُ","en":"the leg","id":"the leg","t":"l-sāqu"},{"a":"بِٱلسَّاقِ","en":"about the leg","id":"about the leg","t":"bil-sāqi"}]},{"n":30,"key":"75:30","arabic":"إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ يَوْمَئِذٍ ٱلْمَسَاقُ","page":578,"juz":29,"en":"To your Lord, that Day, will be the procession.","id":"kepada Tuhanmu lah pada hari itu kamu dihalau.","latinEn":"Ila rabbika yawma-ithin almasaq","latinId":"Ilā rabbika yauma'iżinil-masāq(u).","words":[{"a":"إِلَىٰ","en":"To","id":"To","t":"ilā"},{"a":"رَبِّكَ","en":"your Lord","id":"your Lord","t":"rabbika"},{"a":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","en":"that Day","id":"that Day","t":"yawma-idhin"},{"a":"ٱلْمَسَاقُ","en":"(will be) the driving","id":"(will be) the driving","t":"l-masāqu"}]},{"n":31,"key":"75:31","arabic":"فَلَا صَدَّقَ وَلَا صَلَّىٰ","page":578,"juz":29,"en":"And he [i.e., the disbeliever] had not believed, nor had he prayed.","id":"Karena dia (dahulu) tidak mau membenarkan (Alquran dan Rasul) dan tidak mau melaksanakan salat,","latinEn":"Fala saddaqa wala salla","latinId":"Falā ṣaddaqa wa lā ṣallā.","words":[{"a":"فَلَا","en":"And not","id":"And not","t":"falā"},{"a":"صَدَّقَ","en":"he accepted (the) truth","id":"he accepted (the) truth","t":"ṣaddaqa"},{"a":"وَلَا","en":"and not","id":"and not","t":"walā"},{"a":"صَلَّىٰ","en":"he prayed","id":"he prayed","t":"ṣallā"}]},{"n":32,"key":"75:32","arabic":"وَلَـٰكِن كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰ","page":578,"juz":29,"en":"But [instead], he denied and turned away.","id":"tetapi justru dia mendustakan (Rasul) dan berpaling (dari kebenaran),","l